                                                            <h4 class="subline mb-8 ">
                            Brokers provide services to a retail and institutional client base which increasingly demands a diverse range of products and functionality to match their trading styles and requirements. 
                        </h4>
                                                                <div id="m-6ac728e337b0d" class="m-0 text ">
                            <p><span data-sheets-value="{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;As such, you need to be able to offer the complete range of trading tools to meet your customers' needs whilst still maintaining operational control over account management and risk. 360T has developed a state-of-the-art Broker administration tool which allows straight credit account trading, prime brokerage and margin account dealing. In addition, we offer powerful, robust and cost-efficient technology to support online Broker trading and are an industry leading provider of automation in back-to-back liquidity sourcing.&quot;}" data-sheets-userformat="{&quot;2&quot;:35585,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;14&quot;:[null,2,6710886],&quot;18&quot;:1}">As such, you need to be able to offer the complete range of trading tools to meet your customers&#8217; needs whilst still maintaining operational control over account management and risk. 360T has developed a state-of-the-art Broker administration tool which allows straight credit account trading, prime brokerage and margin account dealing. In addition, we offer powerful, robust and cost-efficient technology to support online Broker trading and are an industry leading provider of automation in back-to-back liquidity sourcing.</span></p>

